      "html": "† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זְאֵב</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.6\">Is 11:6</a></sup> <strong>lobo (</strong>hebraico novo <em>idem</em>, árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">ذِئْبٌ</span> (<em>chacal</em> segundo Hom<sup>NS 303 ff.</sup>; mas ver RS<sup>ZMG 1880, 373</sup> e Doughty<sup>Arabic Deserta i. 327; ii, 144, 145</sup>) aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">דֵּיבָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܕܺܐܒܳܐ</span>, assírio <em>zîbu</em> Dl<sup>S 47</sup>; etíope ዝእብ <em>hiena</em> Di<sup>1056</sup> (acerca da formação cf. Lag<sup>BN 58</sup>); fenício em nome próprio composto <span dir=\"rtl\">זיבקם</span><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">זְאֵב</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:27\" href=\"/Genesis.49.27\">Gn 49:27</a> + 2 vezes; construto <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.6\">Je 5:6</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">זְאֵבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.27\">Ez 22:27</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">זְאֵבֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:8\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.8\">Hb 1:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:3\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.3\">Zp 3:3</a>;—<em>lobo</em>, nunca em narrativa; em predições de paz na era messiânica <span dir=\"rtl\">וְגָר זְאֵב עִם כֶּבֶשׂ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.6\">Is 11:6</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">זְאֵב וְטָלֶה יִרְעוּ כְּאֶחָד</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.25\">Is 65:25</a>; em símile, da ferocidade de Benjamim <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳ זְאֵב יִטְרָ֑ף</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:27\" href=\"/Genesis.49.27\">Gn 49:27</a>; dos cavalos ferozes dos caldeus <span dir=\"rtl\">חַדּוּ מִזְּאֵבֵי עֶרֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:8\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.8\">Hb 1:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קַלּוּ מִנְּמֵרִים</span>); dos príncipes de Judá <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּזְאֵבִים טֹרְפֵי טָ֑רֶף</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.27\">Ez 22:27</a>; metaforicamente dos inimigos de Judá <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.6\">Je 5:6</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">זְאֵב עֲרָבוֹת</span> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְיֵה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נָמֵר</span>); dos juízes corruptos e opressores <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁפְטֶיהָ זְאֵבֵי עֶרֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:3\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.3\">Zp 3:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרָיוֹת שֹׁאֲגִים</span>).",
