      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">זוּב</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: fluir, jorrar (</strong>hebraico novo <em>idem</em>, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוּב</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּיב</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܕܳܒ</span>, todos empregados frequentemente no sentido <strong>4</strong> abaixo; árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">ذَابَ</span> (medial <span dir=\"rtl\">و</span>) <em>derreter-se, dissolver-se, fluir</em><strong>)</strong>—somente<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יָזוּב</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.25\">Lv 15:25</a> etc.; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">זָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.9\">Je 49:9 f.</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">זָבָ֫ה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.19\">Lv 15:19</a> etc.;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>fluir, jorrar</em> (poético), da água que sai da rocha ferida <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:20\" href=\"/Psalms.78.20\">ψ 78:20</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁטַף</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:41\" href=\"/Psalms.105.41\">105:41</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הָלַךְ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.21\">Is 48:21</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נָזַל</span>). <strong>2.</strong>  Particípio frequentemente em <span dir=\"rtl\">זָבַת חָלָב וּדְבַשׁ (אֶרֶץ)</span>, sobretudo da terra prometida, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:8\" href=\"/Exodus.3.8\">Ex 3:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:17\" href=\"/Exodus.3.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:5\" href=\"/Exodus.13.5\">13:5</a> (todos J) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:3\" href=\"/Exodus.33.3\">33:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:27\" href=\"/Numbers.13.27\">Nu 13:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:8\" href=\"/Numbers.14.8\">14:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:14\" href=\"/Numbers.16.14\">16:14</a> (todos JE) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.3\">Dt 6:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.9\">11:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.26.9\">26:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.26.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.3\">27:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.20\">31:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:6\" href=\"/Joshua.5.6\">Jos 5:6</a> (D) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.24\">Lv 20:24</a> (H) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.5\">Je 11:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.22\">32:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.6\">Ez 20:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.15\">15</a>, do Egito <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:13\" href=\"/Numbers.16.13\">Nu 16:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זָב עִמְקֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.4\">Je 49:4</a> (vale fértil de Amom). <strong>3.</strong>  figuradamente <em>escoar-se</em> = <em>definhar</em> (de fome) <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:9\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.9\">La 4:9</a>. <strong>4.</strong>  <em>fluir</em>, de fluxo da mulher (todos P), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.25\">Lv 15:25</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יָזוּב זוֹב דָּמָהּ</span> (ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, זוֹב\" href=\"/BDB,_זוֹב\", dir=\"rtl\">זוֹב</a>); especialmente <em>ter um corrimento</em> (<em>fluxo, corrimento uretral</em>), da mulher <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.25\">Lv 15:25</a> e <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.19\">15:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(תִּהְיֶה זָבָה)</span>; usualmente do homem, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:29\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.29\">2 S 3:29</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצֹרָע</span>); em outros lugares P, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.2\">Lv 15:2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">זָב מִבִּשָׂרוֹ</span>; com acusativo cognato <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.33\">15:33</a>; ordinariamente particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">זָב</span> <em>aquele que tem um corrimento</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.4\">Lv 15:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:8\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:32\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.32\">32</a> (todos P), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.4\">22:4</a> (H; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צָרוּעַ</span>); também <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:2\" href=\"/Numbers.5.2\">Nu 5:2</a> (P; ‖ <em>idem</em>)",
